5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us ensure our new agreement fosters warmth and peace. I wish to understand how our habits change with the seasons.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I want to make sure we handle this in a way that keeps our friendships healthy and avoids any tension.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if some people are paying more than others. I want to know if it is fair for everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm in! But I want to see the actual numbers first. I don't want any nasty surprises in my bank account.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just hope the new system isn't too difficult to manage every month. I don't want it to be a burden.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your kindness is appreciated. Perhaps we can find a way that is simple for everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, that is a very fair point. Let's look into the history of our payments to see if there are patterns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, thank you. I think looking at how other houses do it might help us too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly. I want to know what the costs look like over a full year and if changing things costs us money now.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into how much work the administration actually takes. I don't want anyone to feel stressed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
