35,2,1,talk,Servas,,It seems the physical layout of our house creates unfair needs. Some rooms are naturally colder than others.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,I've seen that payments have been late because people are questioning the amounts. It's creating a bit of a rift.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that some rooms use four times more electricity than others! It really isn't equal right now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills are all over the place—February is huge compared to August. Also, individual meters would be quite expensive to install.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I looked into other methods... and they seem to take a lot of time. Logging readings and templates are very tedious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"If we continue as we are, those in cold rooms may suffer in silence to save money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, if the costs vary so much, maybe a fixed rate would stop the monthly arguments?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"But if one person uses way more, is it fair for the others to pay for it in a fixed rate?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, true, but @Daisuke just said that tracking every single watt is a nightmare. We need a balance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yes... I don't think we want to spend our whole evening doing math every month.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,A system where we don't fear the switch would bring a great sense of liberty to this home.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that if we just split it equally, the people using less will feel resentful, like Minato mentioned.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I just want it to be honest. If we use a lot, we should pay for it, but it shouldn't be a chore.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The upfront cost for meters is too high for me right now. We need something cheaper and more stable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Maybe the simplest way is the best way, even if it's not perfectly precise?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider the options with a spirit of generosity and practicality.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's prioritize the harmony of the house over perfect accounting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I can agree to that, as long as we are all being honest about our usage.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I just want to stop the ""second rent"" feeling in winter. Stability is key.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll support whatever is easiest to maintain.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
