60,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B sounds most promising. It removes the anxiety of the moment and allows us to live comfortably.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,I like Option B too. It prevents the monthly disputes over fluctuating amounts that I saw in the logs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is the most fair since usage varies so much, but @Daisuke said it's a lot of work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is way too expensive to set up. Option B solves my problem with the winter spikes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option A sounds like a lot of work. Option C is the easiest, but Option B is also okay.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, fairness is not just about numbers, but about the peace of mind we grant one another.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, if we go with B, the year-end settle is the only ""big"" job, rather than a monthly struggle.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I see. If we can't do A, then B is better than C because it's more predictable for everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,Exactly. C still leaves us with those wild swings every month. B smooths it out.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If everyone is okay with B, I think I can handle a once-a-year calculation.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have found a path that balances fairness, effort, and comfort.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I feel much better knowing we are choosing something that protects our relationships.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for B. It's a good compromise between fairness and ease.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,B it is for me. No more winter shocks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. B is manageable.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
